  m_text: 'Emilie: "John, watch out for the objects falling from above. This planet''s
    gravity is constantly pulling them toward the ground. As they fall, they gain
    speed, making their impact much more dangerous. That''s why avoiding them is
    so important. Remember: gravity causes objects to accelerate downward, and the
    longer they fall, the greater their speed becomes. Stay focused and make it through
    the trial."'
